      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Object pools are usually used for identical sets of game objects. Your use case is interesting - I haven't heard of someone using a VRC Object Pool for different game objects. I'd be interested in seeing if any other users use it that way.\n\nHave you tried using several VRC Object Pools for each type of object?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
