  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "In addition to pulling sequentially or randomly, it'd be useful if we could pull a specific entry in an ObjectPool on-demand to make it easier for creators to spawn specific items and have them be network-synced.\n\nEg if I have a Sphere, a Cube and a Capsule in my ObjectPool, I could fire a command for TryToSpawn[0] against my ObjectPool to specifically activate the Sphere, or TryToSpawn[2] to call the Capsule.",
